WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:03.036
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:04.036
We hope you're all
doing well tonight

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:05.671
and now, we, if you don't mind,

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:06.839
are going to get to the news.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:08.541
[ Laughter ]
President Biden attended

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.043
a funeral today
at the National Cathedral

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:12.111
and this is a shame --

00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:14.113
it was for the
infrastructure bill.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.214
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.315
President Biden reportedly

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:17.883
held a phone call Monday night

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.752
with House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:21.688
and Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.290
to discuss the debt ceiling
and it worked!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.825
They all slept like babies.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.326
[ Laughter ]
In her new book,

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:30.330
ex-White House Press Secretary
Stephanie Grisham said

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.232
that former President Trump's
anger was "terrifying,"

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:36.469
which makes sense
because so was his joy.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.637
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.038
According to the same book,

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.807
former President Trump would
listen to the song "Memory"

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:44.410
from the musical "Cats"
whenever he was upset.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.112
Of course,
he would just get angrier

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.248
when Lindsey Graham
would forget the words.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.615
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:50.950
[ As Graham ]
The song's about memory,

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.520
but the irony is that's one
of my worst qualities.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.188
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.456
During his testimony yesterday
before the Senate,

00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:00.559
Joint Chiefs of Staff Chairman
General Mark Milley said

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:02.562
that he told
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi,

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.997
after the January attack
on the Capitol, that he was,

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:08.968
"not qualified to determine the
mental health of the president."

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.102
I don't know.

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.771
I think we all are.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:13.572
It's like watching "Joker"
and saying,

00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:16.809
"I think something's up
with him, but I'm not a doctor."

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.678
[ Laughter ]
During his testimony,

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:21.447
Milley called the
U.S. withdrawal from Afghanistan

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:25.818
a "logistical success,
but a strategic failure."

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:27.320
Sort of like
when you buy your wife

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.622
a table saw for Valentine's Day.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:32.024
Logistically,
you got her a gift,

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:33.793
but, strategically...

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.595
mistakes were made.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:37.596
After passing Jeff Bezos
this week

00:01:37.596 --> 00:01:39.865
to, once again, become the
world's richest person,

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:43.169
Tesla CEO Elon Musk said
he was going to send Bezos

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:46.005
a silver medal
and a statue of the number 2,

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.641
but, then, it turned out
the only way to do that was

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:49.876
with Amazon.

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:52.211
[ Laughter ]
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.447
visited Rikers Island jail
this week and said,

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.882
"This is a place that should
have been shut down

00:01:56.882 --> 00:01:58.050
a long time ago."

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.185
Said an employee,

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.486
"This is LaGuardia."

00:02:00.486 --> 00:02:02.288
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.756
[ As de Blasio ]
Ah, makes sense.
I didn't think

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.525
Rikers would have a Cinnabon.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.894
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:11.064
Producers have announced
that the TV series "Law &amp; Order"

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:14.234
will return for its 21st season.

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.870
See, they made you think
it's Dick Wolf's idea,

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.705
but, turns out, it was his wife.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:21.074
[ Laughter ]
That's right, nearly 12 years

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:22.775
after the original series
was canceled,

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.044
producers have announced
that the original "Law &amp; Order"

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.446
will return to NBC
for its 21st season.

00:02:27.446 --> 00:02:29.515
Wow!
So, Trump said

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:30.816
he was going to bring back
law and order,

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:32.818
but Biden actually did it.

00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:34.621
[ Laughter ]
It was announced yesterday

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.555
that disgraced actress
Lori Loughlin

00:02:36.555 --> 00:02:38.324
will return to acting
for the first time

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.826
since serving two months
in prison

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.694
for her role in the
college admissions scandal.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.664
But that's not
why she's disgraced.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.365
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:48.434
U.S. wildlife officials
announced today

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:51.804
that 22 animals and one plant
have become extinct.

00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:54.340
That's right,
22 animals and one plant.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.641
Or, as it's also known,

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:57.243
jambalaya.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:00.946
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.946 --> 00:03:02.849
You told me it made sense.

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:04.517
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.885
That was a monologue, everybody.

